    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay, so it's a trust account. i'm just a bit nervous about the idea of a \"middleman\" having control over such a huge amount of money. feels weird having it out of my hands like that. do they have any special responsibilities to make sure they don't just... i don't know, mismanage it or act weird with it?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
